-- 2010 census blocks (entity_id is BCTCB2010: borocode(1) || tract(6) || block(4)),
-- water included (the *wi variant). Boundaries come from the AtomicPolygon topology
-- (int__boundary__cb2010wi); columns, column order and types match the published layer.

